1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,500
EDGE Grant Replaces PSG: Document Scanning Projects. What changed, and how to prepare, in Singapore

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:15,288
Enterprise Singapore has consolidated its main business grants. PSG, EDG and MRA ceased on 29 September 2026.

3
00:00:15,288 --> 00:00:25,500
From 30 September 2026, businesses apply under the new EDGE Grant. Eligibility and support levels are set by Enterprise Singapore, so check the official page first.

4
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:34,615
Scheme: Productivity Solutions Grant (PSG). Status: Ceased 29 September 2026. Scheme: Enterprise Development Grant (EDG). Status: Ceased 29 September 2026.

5
00:00:34,615 --> 00:00:41,997
Scheme: Market Readiness Assistance (MRA). Status: Ceased 29 September 2026. Scheme: EDGE Grant. Status: Applications from 30 September 2026.

6
00:00:41,997 --> 00:00:46,500
Scheme: Existing applications. Status: Continue to be processed; claims on completion.

7
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:57,742
The PSG worked from a list of pre-approved solutions and vendors. With PSG closed to new applications, that list no longer applies to new projects.

8
00:00:57,742 --> 00:01:04,500
If you planned a scanning project around a PSG package, re-check it against the EDGE Grant terms.

9
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:10,559
1. Read the current terms: confirm eligibility on the Enterprise Singapore website. 2.

10
00:01:10,559 --> 00:01:15,676
Scope the project: volumes, document types, condition, indexing, outputs, retention. 3.

11
00:01:15,676 --> 00:01:25,500
Get an itemised quotation: scanning, preparation, indexing, software, hardware, training. 4. Do not sign or pay yet: check when costs can be committed under the rules.

12
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:33,858
Who decides if a project qualifies? Enterprise Singapore decides, not any vendor. Are existing PSG applications cancelled? No.

13
00:01:33,858 --> 00:01:42,500
Ongoing submissions and projects continue to be processed. Can public-sector buyers use Micrographics Data? Yes. We are a registered GeBIZ supplier.

14
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,574
Request a project assessment. Micrographics Data can scope your digitisation project and issue an itemised written quotation.

